<title>UK: Daimler sees commercial vehicle profits.</title>
<headline>Daimler sees commercial vehicle profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz AG chairman Juergen Schrempp said on Thursday he expected the company's commercial vehicle divison to make a profit this year.</p>
<p>Speaking at news conference, Schrempp said, &quot;I can say it (the commercial vehicle unit) will be profitable this year.&quot;</p>
<p>Daimler had said earlier today that its truck unit made a slight operating loss in the first half of this year.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom + 49 228 260 97150</p>
